    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Tormented Soul on Discord! (Links &amp; Info section for link)</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/700c938a1b13dcec14ef0a99173a9f5c.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/700c938a1b13dcec14ef0a99173a9f5c.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/700c938a1b13dcec14ef0a99173a9f5c.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative AOE-centric Skill Based Action Combat\u2014</strong>The combat in Tormented Soul is extremely intuitive, unique, satisfying, and smooth\u2014with the feel of a third-person shooter brought to fantasy action combat. The combat has added nuance and attention to detail\u2014with the quickswap weapon system utilizing mid-ability swap buffering, there is animation cancels for players to master double-ultimate combos, and above all there is a need to aim your abilities accurately.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/7814f68d05e6b46e0844f5dd841360df.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/7814f68d05e6b46e0844f5dd841360df.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/7814f68d05e6b46e0844f5dd841360df.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Matchmaking  backfills additional players as you play\u2014</strong>All matches are found, regardless of whether its a single party or a full lobby, in around 60 seconds or less\u2014while you are playing we are actively matchmaking for players to add to the match. Our chat system will let you know when players join\u2014so you can jump into the action and still be aware when your corrupted loot is becoming more risky to hold. All progression systems are long-term, meaning joining a match late won't impact your ability to hold your own. While we are early days, we are going to match party members together, but team assignments will be randomized.  So bring a group of friends and have fun competing against each other!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultra-Rare Ancient Equipment!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/14e58e2c2ba0fb72eebb9a8cb5654c4c.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/14e58e2c2ba0fb72eebb9a8cb5654c4c.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/14e58e2c2ba0fb72eebb9a8cb5654c4c.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-rare ancient equipment has a chance to drop from gathering, PvM, &amp; PvP. The piece of Ancient Equipment dropped depends on what you are gathering or slaying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep your items and progression for the season!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/1e7bb4a02cde4fac2c512db296aab50d.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/1e7bb4a02cde4fac2c512db296aab50d.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/1e7bb4a02cde4fac2c512db296aab50d.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each game, your inventory and gear is loaded from a database. Resources and gear progression are kept for the season.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enchant &amp; Regrade your gear\u2014continuous progression for the season!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/44710ac532aaf25ec0375a80dba8790c.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/44710ac532aaf25ec0375a80dba8790c.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/44710ac532aaf25ec0375a80dba8790c.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources held at the end of the match or extracted back to base are cleansed and retained from game to game. These resources can be used to enchant and regrade your gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Custom Loadouts &amp; Swap Mid-Match. Enchants &amp; Regrades apply to gear slots.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/04e03272c9f9de88237fe4a10fef446d.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/04e03272c9f9de88237fe4a10fef446d.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/04e03272c9f9de88237fe4a10fef446d.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loadout system\u2014</strong>Provides you the flexibility to change your playstyle mid-match. Spend hours crafting the perfect build in our Main Menu loadout builder choosing from over 110 armor, weapons, &amp; gems.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Innovative Seamless Combat-Gathering\u2014Over 180 unique items to obtain. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/a6e8ef9b687ab67be5974e006a90e64b.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/a6e8ef9b687ab67be5974e006a90e64b.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/a6e8ef9b687ab67be5974e006a90e64b.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your combat abilities to impact the environment and gather resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High-Stakes</strong>\u00a0<strong>PvP. Partial loot\u2014Corrupt items transfer in PvP\u2014cleanse items at base. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/c61bfec6c3e82dec4133956242b88080.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/c61bfec6c3e82dec4133956242b88080.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/c61bfec6c3e82dec4133956242b88080.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RNG+ system\u2014</strong>Corrupted items, which are lost on PvP death, provide a corruption score which increases your luck to incentivize<strong> </strong>your risk. This is a scaling system that provides you with a better chance at higher drop tables throughout various activities and it also provides a boosted chance to obtain Ultra-Rare Ancient Equipment drops.<br><br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/9f70b057dcc28fe8227932d99c05410b.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/9f70b057dcc28fe8227932d99c05410b.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/9f70b057dcc28fe8227932d99c05410b.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Item\u00a0Value-based Team Scoring with 51 Ranks to climb\u2014</strong>Our team-based gameplay is similar to factions. Choose to help your teammates or run away laughing as they get swarmed and you keep your hard-earned loot. If you want to climb ranks fast though, securing as much value for your team as possible is your goal. Ranks reward valuable base stat bonuses. Whether your hunting enemies alone, farming bosses as a team, or working in smaller groups\u2014there is a wide range of playstyles supported.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend to a Slayer! Exciting Killstreak Buffs with radiating auras. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/13e6369fdb26ebc2f2297f6c9e11bcb6.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/13e6369fdb26ebc2f2297f6c9e11bcb6.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/13e6369fdb26ebc2f2297f6c9e11bcb6.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive additional power at 3, 5, 10, and 20 kills in a row.\u00a0Climb the ranks with killstreaks that reward you with radiating power. Achieve 3, 5, 10, and 20 consecutive kills to unlock powerful buffs and an aura that strikes fear into your enemies. Reach a 20-kill streak and ascend to the status of Slayer, unleashing devastating damage in an explosion of heavenly power, causing even the heavens to hear of your achievement. Will your name echo across the battlefield?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative AOE-centric Skill Based Action Combat\u2014</strong>The combat in Tormented Soul is extremely intuitive, unique, satisfying, and smooth\u2014with the feel of a third-person shooter brought to fantasy action combat. The combat has added nuance and attention to detail\u2014with the quickswap weapon system utilizing mid-ability swap buffering, there is animation cancels for players to master double-ultimate combos, and above all there is a need to aim your abilities accurately.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/7814f68d05e6b46e0844f5dd841360df.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/7814f68d05e6b46e0844f5dd841360df.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/7814f68d05e6b46e0844f5dd841360df.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Matchmaking  backfills additional players as you play\u2014</strong>All matches are found, regardless of whether its a single party or a full lobby, in around 60 seconds or less\u2014while you are playing we are actively matchmaking for players to add to the match. Our chat system will let you know when players join\u2014so you can jump into the action and still be aware when your corrupted loot is becoming more risky to hold. All progression systems are long-term, meaning joining a match late won't impact your ability to hold your own. While we are early days, we are going to match party members together, but team assignments will be randomized.  So bring a group of friends and have fun competing against each other!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultra-Rare Ancient Equipment!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/14e58e2c2ba0fb72eebb9a8cb5654c4c.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/14e58e2c2ba0fb72eebb9a8cb5654c4c.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/14e58e2c2ba0fb72eebb9a8cb5654c4c.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-rare ancient equipment has a chance to drop from gathering, PvM, &amp; PvP. The piece of Ancient Equipment dropped depends on what you are gathering or slaying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep your items and progression for the season!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/1e7bb4a02cde4fac2c512db296aab50d.poster.avif?t=1745821944\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/1e7bb4a02cde4fac2c512db296aab50d.webm?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269360/extras/1e7bb4a02cde4fac2c512db296aab50d.mp4?t=1745821944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each game, your inventory and gear is loaded from a database. Resources and gear progression are kept for the season.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enchant &amp; Regrade your gear\u2014continuous progression for the season!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea